    },
    {
      "post_id": "552994938502533120",
      "text": "@Marikacobbold Yes. Only blessing at this point is gunmen have gone into hiding not attack mode. And bravery of Parisians",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 01:07:22 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5299401902301594e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552981020140531713",
      "text": "a black person drawn as a monkey. Much satire. So joke. @JackofKent",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:12:03 +0000 2015",
