    },
    {
      "post_id": "552982471655297024",
      "text": "@JackofKent je suis charlie",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:17:49 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5297942022784205e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552993281945403393",
      "text": "@NadiaKamil really? People have a right to not be exposed to things that offend them? To what extent?",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 01:00:47 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529928278486794e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553267223369121792",
      "text": "@NadiaKamil @JackofKent Awkward to look at but I *think* it's taking the mickey out of racists.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 19:09:19 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529810201405317e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552982583043424256",
      "text": "@JackofKent and to my paltry number too.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:18:16 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5297942022784205e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552994627494477824",
      "text": "@EE_Zed I just find it gross how so many are willing to post racist imagery on their own feeds.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 01:06:07 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529937514431775e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552987750862180352",
      "text": "@svejky @JackofKent Are crackpot theocrats oppressed in certain middle east countries? Are zionists oppressed in Israel? Be more universal!",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:38:48 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529839509947146e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552993751443177474",
      "text": "@NadiaKamil by that I mean, I agree people have right to be insulted by racist tropes, but should it be banned so people arent hurt?",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 01:02:39 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529932819454034e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552995920275845122",
      "text": "@Marian__Kennedy Must admit to being a little bit nervous about RT the covers but had to be done.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 01:11:16 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529949385025331e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552994839789580288",
      "text": "@NadiaKamil thats completely valid.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 01:06:58 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529946274944778e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553062902912253953",
      "text": "@NadiaKamil @JackofKent that cartoon is making fun of the Rassemblement Bleu Marine, the far right",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 05:37:26 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529810201405317e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552991619549372416",
      "text": "@tanquerel sure. I was aware of the story.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:54:10 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.52991337164075e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552993216048680961",
      "text": "@JackofKent @Marikacobbold Terrific Marika. Feel so strongly about this. Horrified by images used by most of UK press. Irish Times good.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 01:00:31 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5297942022784205e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552979675975151617",
      "text": "@JackofKent And on to my own paltry 300.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:06:43 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5297942022784205e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552994019023015937",
      "text": "@Marian__Kennedy @JackofKent A dark dark day.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 01:03:42 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5299321604868096e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552991482630926336",
      "text": "@NadiaKamil nobody claimed it was high minded. Have you even seen the sheer pornography if it? Surely even racists have a right to publish.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:53:38 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529904450310185e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552997595514408960",
      "text": "@Marikacobbold Worried what might be planning next. Nothing to lose, well equipped, gone missing. Self preservation not usu a priority",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 01:17:55 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529959202758451e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552983950994714626",
      "text": ".@JackofKent slightly confused what this is supposed to represent except that they hatefully caricature ALL oppressed groups?",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:23:42 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5297942022784205e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552987792167682049",
      "text": "@svejky @JackofKent And these were lefties who despised the Front National, so hardly a racist rag just keeping w/ secular French tradition.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:38:58 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529839509947146e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552990669174996992",
      "text": "@JackofKent actually, they're still pretty offensive.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:50:24 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5297942022784205e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552990445031018496",
      "text": "and the magazine then recreated the image of that. How is that satire &amp; not just repeating the racism. @tanquerel @JackofKent",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:49:30 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5298973233525965e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552992360351944706",
      "text": "@NadiaKamil Maybe. Perhaps in compendium and in context it can stand for free speech, not agreeing with words, just their right to say them.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:57:07 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529918493007585e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552991849300758529",
      "text": "@EE_Zed sure. But no need for everyone else to publish it.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:55:05 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5299148263092634e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552992827848679424",
      "text": "@EE_Zed They have a right to say them, people have a right to be offended by harmful dehumanizing tropes, have the right to not have to see",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:58:58 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529923603519447e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    }
